WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.327
The retail project asks you to build two different
outputs from the same facts The

00:00:06.354 --> 00:00:12.505
long table supports trend analysis The wide table
supports a scorecard

00:00:14.255 --> 00:00:19.848
Both should represent the same revenue at different
shapes The project is

00:00:19.874 --> 00:00:24.243
not complete until you compare totals across the
source and both reshaped outputs
